## Installation

<InstallCommand pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui" shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/toggle.json" />

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Toggle } from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/toggle";
</script>

<Toggle>Toggle</Toggle>
```

## API Reference

### Toggle

`Toggle` wraps the Shards toggle and adds the COSS `default` and `outline` variants plus `sm`,
`default`, and `lg` sizes. Use `pressed` for an initial value or `bind:pressed` for controlled state.

See the [Shards Toggle API](https://shardsui.com/svelte/toggle) for state and keyboard props.

